== paid and shipped
[warehouse] holds the goods of 1 as hold-1
[bank] holds 4200 cents for 1
[bank] captures 4200 cents on auth-1
[vans] van-3 takes hold-1 to Lyon
[mail] to ada@example.com: your order 1 leaves today with van-3
-> done: Ok("van-3")

== the card is refused
[warehouse] holds the goods of 2 as hold-2
[bank] refuses 900000 cents for 2
[warehouse] releases hold-2
-> done: Err(Refused("over the card's limit"))

== paid, but no van goes there
[warehouse] holds the goods of 3 as hold-3
[bank] holds 4200 cents for 3
[bank] captures 4200 cents on auth-3
[vans] nothing goes to Atlantis
[bank] refunds pay-auth-3
[warehouse] releases hold-3
-> done: Err(NoVan("no van goes to Atlantis"))

== the bank is busy the first time
[warehouse] holds the goods of 17 as hold-17
[bank] is busy, ask again later
[bank] holds 4200 cents for 17
[bank] captures 4200 cents on auth-17
[vans] van-3 takes hold-17 to Oslo
[mail] to ada@example.com: your order 17 leaves today with van-3
-> done: Ok("van-3")

